2. SUMM-RE corpus — the French model
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  Corpus      SUMM-RE
              https://huggingface.co/datasets/linagora/SUMM-RE
  Producer    LINAGORA
  Funding     Agence Nationale de la Recherche, project ANR-20-CE23-0017
  License     Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International
              (CC BY-SA 4.0), https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

BudgieScribe-fr was trained, in part, on transcripts and audio segments from
the SUMM-RE corpus produced by LINAGORA within project ANR-20-CE23-0017,
distributed under CC BY-SA 4.0.

This use is declared voluntarily. The SUMM-RE corpus itself has been neither
modified nor redistributed by us. The derived works built from it (dictation-
sized units, decoded transcription conventions, raw-to-clean pairs produced by
a teacher model) are Adapted Material in the sense of CC BY-SA and are kept
strictly local: no pair set, manifest, audio segment or transcript derived
from SUMM-RE is distributed, in any repository, publication, product build,
training artifact or report.

The model weights are published under the widely held reading, shared by
Creative Commons, that training a model is not adapting the corpus, so the
weights are not a derivative work of it. This point has not been settled in
court. Downstream integrators should be aware of it.


